{"title": "Elemental Retort (passive feature)", "pageid": 20621, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elemental_Retort_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elemental_Affinity_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Elemental_Affinity_Damage.webp/300px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage.webp, /w/images/f/ff/Elemental_Affinity_Damage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Elemental_Affinity_Damage.webp/300px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Elemental_Affinity_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Elemental Retort</b> is a special passive feature that grants a special reaction when attacked.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When attacked, the affected entity can draw on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Siphon\" title=\"Elemental Siphon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Siphoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Siphon\" title=\"Elemental Siphon\">Siphoned</a> magic to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Retort\" title=\"Elemental Retort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Retort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Retort\" title=\"Elemental Retort\">Elemental Retort</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_RamazithsTower_ElementalRebuke</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_RamazithsTower_ElementalRebuke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_RamazithsTower_ElementalRebuke\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When attacked, can use <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Siphon\" title=\"Elemental Siphon\">siphoned</a> magic to cast <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Retort\" title=\"Elemental Retort\">Elemental Retort</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715050715\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 991/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7783/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3096/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 130/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 759999/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.391      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.391      1 -total\n 29.97%   11.207      2 Template:SAI\n 27.69%   10.355      2 Template:Icon_link\n 26.62%    9.953      2 Template:Icon_text\n 23.39%    8.746      5 Template:Trim\n 23.32%    8.719      1 Template:Uid\n 18.18%    6.796      2 Template:Ifempty\n 14.66%    5.480      1 Template:Template_style\n  9.98%    3.730      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20621-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715050715 and revision id 392466. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}